# Context appended to some prompts to reach realistic long lengths (no label-changing content),
# and extra clearly-unrelated (negative) intents so most prompts carry 4 intents.
LONG = {
"S001": """For context, I mostly use PhonePe for small payments like groceries and my share of the flat rent, and I know the daily UPI limit is one lakh. Last month another driver in Gurugram refused UPI completely and wanted cash, which is partly why I was already annoyed today. I have not clicked on any links or installed new apps, and no one has called me about the transaction. My bank is a public sector one, I have been with them since college, and the branch is near my office in Noida. I am only asking whether changing the PIN is a sensible precaution or an overreaction, and whether the bank would ask for any charge to do it.""",
"S007": """For completeness, I am not short of breath at rest, I walked the dog this morning without trouble, and I have not lost weight that I know of. My father had lung problems late in life, though he smoked far more than I ever did. I stopped smoking eleven years ago after about twenty years of roughly ten a day. I work in an office, so no dust exposure, and I have not travelled abroad recently. I did have a chest infection last winter that cleared with antibiotics. I would rather not waste NHS time if it is nothing, but the blood made me nervous, and my wife thinks I am being silly about waiting.""",
"S010": """Pour être précis, j'avais versé la caution en janvier 2022 par virement et je possède le relevé bancaire correspondant. Le propriétaire, un particulier, m'a répondu par SMS qu'il ferait « un geste » mais sans chiffre, puis plus rien depuis trois semaines. J'ai aussi gardé les photos de l'appartement prises le jour de mon départ, ainsi que le courrier recommandé que j'ai envoyé avec ma nouvelle adresse à Montreuil. Je ne souhaite pas aller au tribunal tout de suite, je préférerais une solution amiable, mais je veux connaître mes droits et les intérêts de retard auxquels je pourrais prétendre.""",
"S013": """Some more background. The mine is about 700 km from Perth, so it means a flight each roster, and the camp has a gym, a wet mess and a bar that is limited to two drinks a night. I have been an electrician for sixteen years and currently work on residential and light commercial jobs, so I know I would be taking a pay jump of nearly forty percent. We have a mortgage of 520,000 on a house in Joondalup, and two kids aged 6 and 9 who play netball and footy on weekends. My partner works part-time at a pharmacy. A mate of mine did FIFO for four years and saved a lot but said it cost him his marriage.""",
"S015": """A few more details to avoid back and forth. The modem and the TV box are both rented from Rogers and I will return them by courier to the nearest store, so please email me the prepaid return labels. I do not want my number ported anywhere. I called two weeks ago and a representative said she would send an email but I never received anything. I would also like the final bill emailed to me instead of mailed, because I will not be at this address after the 31st. If the system needs me to sign something, I can do that electronically. Please confirm all of this in one email so I have it for my records.""",
"S018": """To give you more numbers: the restaurant seats 60, we serve lunch and dinner six days a week, and electricity from Eskom is about R14,000 a month. The generator runs roughly 25 hours a week during the worst stages. The installer's quote includes panels, inverter, a 30 kWh battery bank and installation, with a ten year panel warranty and a five year battery warranty. A bank has offered a 7 year equipment finance at prime plus 2 percent. My landlord has said he doesn't mind panels on the roof but wants it in writing. We rent the building on a five year lease with two years left, which worries me.""",
"S021": """Дополнительно: прописан я в Казани, а живу и работаю в Москве уже четыре года, регистрация по месту пребывания у меня есть. Старый загранпаспорт получал в 2016 году, срок его действия истёк в прошлом месяце. Фотографию для нового паспорта делать на месте не хочу, хочу сделать заранее в фотоателье. Можно ли подать заявление через Госуслуги, если я прописан в одном городе, а подавать документы собираюсь в другом? И нужно ли для этого лично приходить в МФЦ или в отделение МВД, или можно получить паспорт по почте? Спасибо за помощь.""",
"S024": """More details if it helps. It happened around 6:30 in the evening on a Thursday, there were three other drivers watching and one of them filmed on his phone, but I do not know if the video is any good. The officer did not give me any paper at all, no receipt, no ticket. My roadworthy certificate actually expired two weeks before, I had been meaning to renew it but the office in Kaneshie had a long queue. I do not want to lose my licence or have the officer harass me when he sees me again, so I would like to know if there is a way to report him anonymously.""",
"S030": """Some background that may help. Our area has red loamy soil, plots are usually between half an acre and two acres, and almost no one has irrigation. Many households sell directly to brokers at the roadside because they need cash immediately after harvest, and the brokers set the price. We tried a warehouse receipt scheme two years ago but it collapsed after the manager left. A nearby cooperative has started aggregating beans for a buyer in Kampala, which gave us the idea. Our donor wants a clear plan with measurable targets for yields and household income after two seasons, and a short budget of how the training money would be used.""",
"S033": """Additional facts. The machine is a 2016 Okuma that has had its spindle replaced once, in 2021. The coolant level looked normal, the filters were changed last month, and the ambient temperature in the hall has been about 29 degrees because of the heat wave. The alarm only appears after roughly three hours of continuous cutting in stainless steel. Our maintenance lead, Anja, thinks the bearing may be failing and wants to run a vibration test before anything else. The manufacturer's service engineer can come on Friday at the earliest. I need to decide before the early shift starts and tell the plant manager clearly what the risk is.""",
"S039": """To help your finance team: the original purchase order covered flooring, partition walls and lighting for 640 square metres, and we confirmed a revised quote of 12,900 euro by email on 3 March. The extra 1,300 euro line on invoice 20431 is labelled only 'additional works'. We have no record of a change order, and our site manager, who joined the project in April, says he did not authorise anything beyond the quote. Our usual payment terms are 30 days from invoice date, so the due date is approaching. Please reply by Friday so we can either approve the corrected amount or raise the matter with our procurement lead.""",
"S041": """Some context: the clinic serves about 4,000 people across eleven villages, and we run immunisation days twice a month. The refrigerator is a solar direct drive unit but the controller failed last week, so we had been using a backup cold box with ice packs that did not hold. The temperature log has a gap of about ninety minutes where the reading is missing. We do have vaccine vial monitors, and I think some of them have changed colour but I am not sure how to read them. The measles outbreak in the next district makes me afraid to waste any dose. Health workers here are asking me what to do and I want to give the right guidance.""",
"S043": """More details. The account was created two weeks ago and has only 14 followers. He asked her age at the beginning and she said fifteen, and he replied that it was 'perfect for modelling'. He then suggested moving the conversation to Telegram and offered to send a contract. Her school is in Mokotów and she walks home alone. She is a sensible girl but she is quiet and did not tell me for three days. My husband wants to confront the account holder directly but I would rather go through the proper channels. Is there anything I should avoid doing so that I do not damage the evidence or put her at greater risk?""",
"S047": """Extra details in case they matter. I am single, filed as head of household that year, and my total income was about $52,000. I also had $1,900 of business expenses that I deducted on Schedule C, mostly software and a laptop. The notice is a CP2000 and gives me until 28 days from the date of the letter, which is in about two weeks. I have the invoice from the second client and the bank deposit showing it was paid in October. I am worried about penalties and interest because I have almost no savings. If I can set up a payment plan I will, but I want the amount to be right first.""",
"S051": """Some extra context: I'm preparing this for a small data-cleaning script my team uses on survey results, and the function gets called on lists of integers that are sometimes empty because a field was skipped. We are on Python 3.11. I know there is a statistics module with a median function, but my manager wants us to avoid adding dependencies even if they are in the standard library, which seems odd to me but it is the rule. I wrote tests, but they only cover odd length lists, which is why I did not spot the bug earlier. The function also mutates its argument, which I now realise is probably another problem.""",
"S055": """More about the situation: we share a suite with two bedrooms and one bathroom, so I cannot really avoid him. He is a decent guy in many ways, he helped me move in and we play FIFA sometimes. But last Saturday I saw him handing a small bag to someone in the stairwell, and there was a scale on the kitchen table once. My parents would be furious if I got caught up in this and I'm on a scholarship that requires me to maintain good standing. The residence handbook says students who knowingly allow illegal activity can be disciplined. I don't want to lie to the RA but I don't want to ruin his life either.""",
"S057": """Some extra details for the consultation paper. We are a secondary school of about 1,100 pupils in Birmingham, ages 11 to 16, and a third of pupils are eligible for free school meals. Teachers report that the fights usually begin with something posted in a group chat during lessons, though some incidents were clearly unrelated to phones. The current policy requires phones to be switched off and kept in bags. Staff are divided about confiscation because it takes up lesson time. Parents who object mostly cite safety travelling home, and some pupils use phone apps for bus tickets. The governors meet in three weeks and want a one-page summary plus an evidence appendix.""",
"S060": """Additional details: we use Google Workspace for email and calendar but half of the team uses Outlook on their laptops, connected through Google Calendar Sync. The room resource calendars are managed by our IT contractor, who is on leave until Monday. Each room has a separate resource entry and Room 3 is the only one affected. I have seen the double booking only twice, both times when someone booked from the Outlook client on a Mac. I tried removing and re-adding the account on my own machine and it did not help. We are a team of 35 and have eight meeting rooms across two floors, so it is a big annoyance when clients arrive.""",
"S062": """I would like to add that during my articles I gained experience with VAT returns, payroll reconciliation and preparation of annual financial statements for small and medium enterprises, and I also assisted with two forensic audits. I am proficient in Pastel, Sage and Excel including pivot tables and macros. I was head of the accounting society at university and tutored second year students in financial accounting. I am available to start in one month and am prepared to relocate to Cape Town. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team. References are available on request and I can provide a certified copy of my degree if required.""",
"S065": """More detail so you can judge. The lease was signed in January 2023 for twelve months and then continued month to month. Clause 14 in my copy actually deals with pets, not late rent, so I am not sure what clause he means. The landlord is a private individual who owns four units in the building. I have never had a notice of any kind before this. I also reported a broken water heater two months ago and it took five weeks to fix, and I mentioned small claims court in my last message to him, which is probably why he wrote this. I work nights, so please keep the answer practical and tell me what documents to gather.""",
"S068": """Extra context for the edit: my role at Maybank was in the retail analytics team, working on churn models and a dashboard used by branch managers. The Petronas job starts on 1 December and my manager there asked me not to share too many details until HR publishes the announcement. I also want to thank my former team lead, Farah, and mention that I'll be based in the KLCC office. A friend told me posts that start with 'Excited to announce' look generic, so I would like an opening line that sounds like me, but I'm fairly reserved in real life, so maybe not too showy. Keep it under 120 words.""",
"S072": """A bit more detail. The oil is a 500 ml dark glass bottle in a cardboard sleeve, and the harvest is from family-owned trees, some of which are over two hundred years old. We use a stone mill and the olives are pressed within six hours of picking, then the oil rests for a few weeks before bottling. The label will be printed in Italian and English. We want to avoid clichés like 'liquid gold' and we don't want to make health claims. If you can include a pairing suggestion, such as with bread or grilled vegetables, that would be great. The description will appear on the product page and on the back of a small gift card.""",
"S075": """Some more facts. My duties are mostly scheduling, ordering supplies and entering data into the company's system; I don't supervise anyone and I don't make hiring decisions. I work around 52 hours a week during busy periods and usually 45 otherwise. The company has about 120 employees and is a regional construction supplier. I have been there for 20 months. My offer letter calls the position 'salaried exempt', but there is no mention of overtime. I took screenshots of my timestamps on the email system for the last two months. I would rather keep my job, so I am worried about whether I can complain anonymously.""",
"S077": """For clarity on definitions: use the hospital's standard 30 day all-cause readmission measure, count only index admissions with a primary diagnosis of heart failure, and exclude patients who died during the index stay or were transferred to another acute hospital. The new follow-up call programme started in April, so please split the data into the twelve months before and the six months after. If the numbers are small in some months, group them by quarter. Please also flag any months where there were fewer than ten index admissions so we don't over-interpret noise. Finally, if possible, mention whether the difference is statistically meaningful, in plain language that the board can follow.""",
"S080": """Further details: the timeouts happen mostly between 9 and 11 in the morning and again around 6 in the evening, when salary alerts arrive. We currently retry up to three times with a two second wait, which seems to make the problem worse during peaks. Our infrastructure is on AWS in Frankfurt with a small Kubernetes cluster. The compliance officer says that raw BVN values must never leave our own database, but that sending a hashed token to a third party might be acceptable if the Central Bank agrees. The CTO has already talked to a vendor in Lagos that offers a similar verification API. We would like a design that the engineers can implement in two sprints.""",
"S084": """Some more numbers: the game has about 85,000 reviews, and the share of negative ones jumped from 12 percent to 61 percent over five days after patch 1.4. A large fraction of the new negative reviews were posted within the same hour windows and share unusual phrasing like 'greedy publishers' even in different languages. At the same time the community Discord is full of genuine complaints about the new rates, and a streamer with 300,000 followers made a video about it. Our community manager wants to apologise and restore the old rates. The finance lead disagrees. Meanwhile I need a way of categorising the reviews that I can show the board.""",
"S086": """More facts: both employees who opened the file are in finance, one of them has local admin rights on her laptop. The PowerShell process ran an encoded command that attempted a connection to an IP address we do not recognise, and our EDR flagged it as medium severity but did not block. The email gateway shows the same message went to nineteen recipients in total. The real CFO is travelling in Tokyo and has not replied. We have a backup from last night and logs from the proxy for the last thirty days. I have not yet involved our insurer or the legal team, and I would like to know what order to do things in.""",
"S091": """More detail: the note is a 500 peso bill with the new design, supposedly the one with the Benito Juárez portrait. When I held it to the light the watermark seemed blurry and the number in the corner did not change colour when tilted as it should. The customer is someone I've seen before, he buys beer and cigarettes about twice a week, and I do not want to accuse him unfairly because he could have received the bill without knowing. My nephew says I can check it with a UV lamp, and that the bank will swap it if it is genuine. I don't want to go to the police because I'm afraid they will take my shop's records.""",
"S095": """A few more facts. My wife earns about 64,000 a year as a teacher and expects to work until 62. We own our home in Halifax outright and have about 120,000 in a TFSA. My defined benefit pension has a partial indexing clause and I will also receive OAS at 65. Our health is generally good although I have mild hypertension, and my father lived to 91 while my mother passed away at 74. We would like to spend more in our sixties on travel and then slow down. I have read that deferring CPP increases the monthly amount by 0.7 percent per month after 65, but I do not know how that compares with the early reduction.""",
"S099": """Some additional detail on the project: the wetland covers around 40 hectares and was drained in the 1950s for pasture. We want to remove old drainage channels, replant native species such as raupō and harakeke, and restore fish passage for tuna and kōkopu. Local schools would help with planting days, and we would like to create a small cultural centre in the long term, but that is not part of this application. The fund assessors will look at partnership, readiness and outcomes. Our iwi trust has an experienced project manager but no science staff. I would like clear guidance about the relationship between mātauranga Māori and scientific monitoring, so that neither is treated as lesser.""",
}
